flowchart TD
    A[Define labels and keywords] --> B[Crawl images from Naver and DuckDuckGo]
    B --> C[Save raw images by label]
    C --> D[Remove corrupted and too-small images]
    D --> E[Convert to RGB JPEG and rename files]
    E --> F[Detect duplicates with pHash/dHash]
    F --> G{Hamming distance <= threshold?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Move to data/duplicates]
    G -- No --> I[Keep in data/cleaned]
    I --> J[Manual review and reject wrong labels]
    J --> K[Dataset statistics and visualization]
    K --> L[Upload cleaned dataset to Kaggle]
    L --> M[Stratified train/val/test split]
    M --> N[Preprocess and augment train images]
    N --> O[Train MobileNet from scratch]
    N --> P[Train ResNet from scratch]
    O --> Q[Evaluate on test set]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Compare metrics and visualize predictions]
    R --> S[Save best models and artifacts]

